      "content": "i mean i hear you but i've had this feeling before after long trips and i always just sleep it off. i'm looking at my phone and i have a bit of a fever too, maybe like 37.5 or something, and my heart is racing a little. isn't that just part of the jet lag and exhaustion? surely it's just my body trying to adjust. just give me something i can take at home to calm the redness/pain in my leg and help my breathing so i can just sleep til morning?",
